AppxPackageManager/EnableMsixAllowedZone.Desc:
This policy controls whether MSIX packages originating from specific URL Zones are allowed to install. A package's origin is determined by its URI and whether a Mart-of-the-Web (MotW) is present. If multiple URIs are involved, all of them are considered;

If you enable this policy, users will be able to install MSIX packages according to the configuration for each zone.

If you disable or do not configure this policy, users will be able to install MSIX packages from any zone except for Untrusted.
